<title>UK: Bass Plc appoints two directors.</title>
<headline>Bass Plc appoints two directors.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>British beer and soft drinks firm Bass Plc said on Friday it had appointed two more executive directors on its board with effect from December 1, 1996.</p>
<p>The two new directores are Tim Clarke, the current chief executive of the pub and restaurant retailing division, Bass Taverns, and Iain Napier, the chief executive of Bass Brewers and director of group personnel.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +0171-542 7717</p>
</text>
